:: Manor Heist Danube Leave Dining
<<effects>>

The coast seems clear, so you slip into the dining room you entered through. You approach the window and open it easily, stepping through into the courtyard. Everything seems calm as you slink around the edge of the courtyard, sticking to the shadows. You're almost at the broken wall when you hear the main gate clang open. 
<br><br>

Turning to look you see a large group of police officers running through the courtyard to the front door. You hear more sirens in the distance.
<br><br>

You leave the commotion behind you as you clamber back over the wall.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Manor Heist Danube Leave Main
<<effects>>

You hear people talking in the dining room, and you can just make out the words "...point of entry." They know where you came in from. With no other choice, you fling open the front door. Directly into a large group of police officers. You run around them before they can recover, dashing for the broken portion of wall. The group shouts and follows after you.
<br><br>

You make it to the wall and clamber over the edge just as the cops reach you. Their grasping hands just miss you as you slide over the edge, breaking into a sprint when you hit the ground. Soon you leave the sirens and shouts behind you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
